          "expr": "100 * sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",service=~\"$service\",status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",service=~\"$service\"}[5m])), 1)",
